{"title": "Synergetic Moments", "pageid": 28343, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Synergetic_Moments", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Synergetic Moments</b> is a passive feature that adds damage equal to your spellcasting ability after inflicting a condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you inflict a condition, gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Synergy_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Synergy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Synergy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Synergy_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Synergy (Condition)\">Arcane Synergy</a> for 2 turns.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Arcane_Synergy\"> Condition: Arcane Synergy </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Synergy_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Synergy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Synergy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Synergy_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Synergy (Condition)\">Arcane Synergy</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Weapon attacks deal additional damage equal to affected entity's <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spellcasting_Ability_and_Proficiency\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Casting Ability Modifier</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy\" title=\"Diadem of Arcane Synergy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Diadem_of_Arcane_Synergy\" title=\"Diadem of Arcane Synergy\">Diadem of Arcane Synergy</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Jhe%27rezath\" title=\"Jhe'rezath\">Jhe'rezath</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Synergetic Moments triggers under many circumstances even though it appears it should not, due to hidden technical conditions, such as when a ranged weapon attack misses, when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a> is cast near enemies, or when revealing an invisible enemy with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"See Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-See_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/See_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/See_Invisibility\" title=\"See Invisibility\">See Invisibility</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200240\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2013/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18780/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5681/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 145/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968664/52428